  "title": "Pilau Rice",
  "subtitle": "Basmati rice cooked with whole spices and onion",
  "excerpt": "Basmati rice cooked with toasted whole spices, onion, and a measure of stock. The spices colour the rice golden and give it a gentle fragrance without overpowering it.",
  "type": "RECIPE",
